# VHS Tape: Instant Offline Mock Server
# Output: offline_serve_demo.gif

Output examples/tapes/offline_serve_demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20

Type "# Spin up an offline stdio mock server from a recorded MCP session"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "mcptracer serve <session-id>"
Enter
Sleep 4s